<title>UK: BASKETBALL-EUROLEAGUE RESULT.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-EUROLEAGUE RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of men's EuroLeague basketball match on Thursday night:</p>
<p>In Istanbul: Efes Pilsen (Turkey) 87 Dynamo Moscow (Russia) 84 (55-40)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Efes Pilsen - Vasili Karasev 18, Petar Naumowski 17</p>
<p>Dynamo Moscow - Maksim Astanin 18, Vitaly Nosov 15</p>
